    "name": "My Taskbar Farm",
    "steam_appid": 3326530,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My Taskbar Farm is a minimalist idle farming simulator for your taskbar. Perfect for playing while you multitask on your PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326530/extras/e861267840255e63fd773f9f37cc2a76.avif?t=1747919852\" data-has-big width=800 height=363 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raise Farm Animals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a chicken and watch it lay eggs while you work. Unlock new animals as you progress, from adorable cows to fluffy sheep and truffle-hunting pigs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automate and Build.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy drones to help with gathering resources. Upgrade your little bots for greater efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase aviaries and barns to free up space and focus production in one place. Upgrade buildings to collect and sell products automatically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multitasking:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My Taskbar Farm is designed to sit comfortably on your taskbar, letting you manage your farm while doing other tasks, all without demanding much of your attention.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My Taskbar Farm is a minimalist idle farming simulator for your taskbar. Perfect for playing while you multitask on your PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326530/extras/e861267840255e63fd773f9f37cc2a76.avif?t=1747919852\" data-has-big width=800 height=363 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raise Farm Animals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a chicken and watch it lay eggs while you work. Unlock new animals as you progress, from adorable cows to fluffy sheep and truffle-hunting pigs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automate and Build.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy drones to help with gathering resources. Upgrade your little bots for greater efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase aviaries and barns to free up space and focus production in one place. Upgrade buildings to collect and sell products automatically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multitasking:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My Taskbar Farm is designed to sit comfortably on your taskbar, letting you manage your farm while doing other tasks, all without demanding much of your attention.</p>",
